<p><b>QuineAvoiding("漢字", "")</b>  is the <a href="/wiki/Constant_language#Quine_avoidance" title="Constant language">quine-avoiding constant language</a> <code><a href="/wiki/Constant_language#Quine_avoidance" title="Constant language">QuineAvoiding</a>("漢字","")</code>, inspired by chinese characters. Its purpose is print "Chinese characters" in Chinese without allowing a quine.
</p>
